ontoksd:ProjectAssessmentStrategyType rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                               skos:Concept ;
                                      skos:inScheme ontoksd:AssessmentStrategyScheme .


###  http://purl.org/ontoksd#Project_Artifact
ontoksd:Project_Artifact rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
